\par\par \b \uc2  Dollar risks rejection in test of longtime range. \b0\par\par\uc2      By Wayne Cole \par \uc2 984 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 November 2000\par 07:42\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      TOKYO, Nov 16 (Reuters) - The dollar held close to two-week \par \par \uc2  highs on the yen in Tokyo on Thursday and was challenging the top \par \par \uc2  of a trading range that has contained it for the last nine \par \par \uc2  months. \par \par \uc2      It was aided by political uncertainty in Japan, where \par \par \uc2  speculation grows day by day that deeply unpopular Prime Minister \par \par \uc2  Yoshiro Mori will be ousted for a new face, though perhaps not \par \par \uc2  the all-out reformer markets would truly like. \par \par \uc2      For once the euro took a secondary role as potentially \par \par \uc2  euro-bearish developments in the U.S. election were balanced by \par \par \uc2  the market's paranoia over possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2      "It's all been about dollar/yen today, which is a change," \par \par \uc2  said a U.S. bank dollar/yen dealer with evident relief. \par \par \uc2      "We're trying the top of this huge range and if it can get \par \par \uc2  past 110.00 the sky's the limit," he added. \par \par \uc2      In late Tokyo trade the dollar was making threatening \par \par \uc2  gestures at 108.80 yen having risen )   yen on Wednesday to a \par \par \uc2  108.94 high. \par \par \uc2      The lack of a significant pullback left most dealers looking \par \par \uc2  for a test of 109.00 yen and then the recent rally high, and \par \par \uc2  major resistance, at 109.30. \par \par \uc2      Beyond that lay another big chart barrier at 109.60 and then \par \par \uc2  the magic 110.00 level, a line that has not been crossed in more \par \par \uc2  than nine months. However, dealers cautioned that its very \par \par \uc2  longevity made it all the harder to clear. \par \par \uc2  "The dollar's tried again and again to break 110.00 and \par \par \uc2  failed every time, so people tend to assume it will again. That's \par \par \uc2  important because speculators will be looking to take profits as \par \par \uc2  quickly as possible once we're above 109.00," said the trader. \par \par \uc2      "In effect, their expectations become self-fulfilling." \par \par \uc2      RECOUNT VS \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2      The euro also held firm on the yen at 93.30 having climbed \par \par \uc2  from around 92.80 on Wednesday, but it remained subdued on the \par \par \uc2  dollar at $0.8578 from $0.8570 in New York on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2      It came under slight pressure after Florida's state secretary \par \par \uc2  disallowed hand counted votes delivered after a Tuesday deadline, \par \par \uc2  a move which dealers assumed would favour Republican George W. \par \par \uc2  Bush. \par \par \uc2  But the campaign of Democrat Al Gore immediately said it \par \par \uc2  would challenge the decision in the Supreme Court, leaving the \par \par \uc2  presidential race as undecided as ever. \par \par \uc2  The market believes a Bush administration would be less \par \par \uc2  likely to join coordinated \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in defence of the euro, \par \par \uc2  as well as sticking to the strong dollar policy. \par \par \uc2  Bush's economic adviser Lawrence Lindsey drove home the point \par \par \uc2  late on Wednesday by forcefully denying a Jiji newswire report \par \par \uc2  that he might favour a weaker dollar. \par \par \uc2  But euro bears were restrained by the risk of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  from the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which bought euros twice last \par \par \uc2  week when the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  looked in danger of breaching 85 cents. \par \par \uc2  That risk was heightened by ECB Board member Eugenio Domingo \par \par \uc2  Solans who said on Wednesday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue \par \par \uc2  to act to support the euro because an undervalued \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  risks \par \par \uc2  losing both credibility and stability. \par \par \uc2  The ECB holds its regular policy meeting on Thursday and, \par \par \uc2  while no change in interest rates is expected, dealers suspected \par \par \uc2  it might mark the occasion by \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  again. \par \par \uc2  POLITICS A PASSING YEN BURDEN \par \par \uc2  In \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Prime Minister Mori's position looked increasingly \par \par \uc2  precarious as jockeying went on within the ruling Liberal \par \par \uc2  Democratic Party to have him replaced. \par \par \uc2  While such uncertainty lasted it would offer speculators a \par \par \uc2  good excuse to sell yen, but many dealers argued that Japan was a \par \par \uc2  different case which did not offer much downside. \par \par \uc2  "The markets may even cheer a change of leader in the medium \par \par \uc2  term in the hope more palatable decisions will be made," said \par \par \uc2  Patrick Bennett, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at UBS Warburg in Singapore. \par \par \uc2  "And what's interesting is that all these bearish factors out \par \par \uc2  there are very well-known and by extension very well priced in. \par \par \uc2  So betting on the yen weakening significantly from here is not \par \par \uc2  appropriate at this time," he added. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  bid prices at 0628 GMT. All data taken from Reuters \par \par \uc2  with percent change calculated from the daily U.S. close at 2130 \par \par \uc2  GMT. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par \tab \tab \tab      