\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Euro bounces from post- \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  troughs. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Shinichi Kishima \par \uc2 530 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Oktober 2000\par 12:07\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, Oct 6 (Reuters) - The euro bounced from its lowest levels against the dollar since last month's concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday as the market remained jittery about prospects that monetary authorities could strike again soon. \par \par \uc2  Disenchanted by the euro's inability to draw support from Thursday's surprise interest rate hike by the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the market initially pushed the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to its lowest since September 22, when monetary authorities of the euro zone, the United States, \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Britain and Canada jointly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  However, traders remained wary of triggering a further round of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  action, and those who had sold the euro earlier quickly bought back the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "If euro/dollar, on a day when the ECB surprises the market with a rate hike, closes below where it opened, it has to tell you something about the underlying sentiment," said Johnathan Bayley, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst at BNP Paribas in Paris. "But we haven't seen a sharp move lower, which tells you that fear of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is still very much alive. The market's worried about being caught short." \par \par \uc2  At 0930 GMT, the euro was trading at $0.8732/37, up more than a quarter cent on the day and a half cent above two-week lows around $0.8675 hit earlier in Asian trading. \par \par \uc2  "We fell below \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  levels so there is an increasing risk over the next few days that the ECB will come back in to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Mitul Kotecha, head of global \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  at Credit Agricole Indosuez in London. \par \par \uc2  The single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  also bounced more than a half yen against the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , clawing back above the psychologically important 95-yen level. \par \par \uc2  U.S. EMPLOYMENT REPORT IN FOCUS \par \par \uc2  Analysts said traders seemed inclined to refrain from taking large positions for now, despite overwhelmingly bearish sentiment on the euro prevailing in the market, due in part to a long weekend in the United States and Japan. \par \par \uc2  The closely watched U.S. employment report due out at 1230 GMT also kept traders cautious, particularly in the light of the wobbly U.S. stock market in recent weeks. \par \par \uc2  "U.S data is very important because the U.S. Fed has expressed concern about the tightness of the labour market," said Audrey Childe-Freeman, economist at CIBC World Markets. \par \par \uc2  "If we get a strong number, it will bring nervousness in the market and it may help the euro." \par \par \uc2  Economists polled by Reuters have, on average, forecast non-farm payrolls to rise by 232,000 and the jobless rate to stay unchanged at 4.1 percent, with average hourly earnings rising a moderate 0.3 percent. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was slightly weaker against the yen, trading nearly one percent below Thursday's seven-week highs of around 109.60 yen, undermined by some pre-weekend profit-taking. \par \par \uc2  Traders said a strong earthquake measuring 7.1 on the open-ended Richter scale which rocked western Japan on Friday had had little impact on the yen so far, as the damage was seen confined to rural areas. \par \par \uc2  Elsewhere, the Australian dollar fell to a record trough around $0.5280. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dwa6057m8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
