\par\par \b \uc2  BOJ bought estimated 1.53 bln euros on Sept 22. \b0\par\par\uc2 208 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 September 2000\par 12:36\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Sept 29 (Reuters) - The Bank of Japan (BOJ) is estimated to have bought around 1.53 billion euros in the joint \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  conducted on September 22 to support the European \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , bankers said on Friday. \par \par \uc2  Data relased on Friday showed that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  paid 144 billion yen to the private sector during September through its special \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  account, which mostly represents \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  It was the first time since April that the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ acts as an agent for the MOF and conducts actual \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  through transactions with brokers and commercial banks. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ said last Friday it had bought euros on its own account in the first concerted action among the central banks of the United States, Europe and \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  since 1995. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  drove the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  up from around $0.8620 to as high as $0.9040 on the day. \par \par \uc2  Against the yen, it rose from around 92 yen to as high as 96.20 yen. It had fallen to lifetime lows of $0.8439 and 90.05 yen, through brokers, on September 20. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw9t05ycu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
