\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Yen loses shine on Japan downgrade, euro holds up. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Sabrina Ghani \par \uc2 836 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 September 2000\par 12:15\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, Sept 8 (Reuters) - The yen softened across the board on Friday undermined by a downgrade of Japan's sovereign debt, while the euro held nearly a cent above this week's record lows against the dollar as euro zone finance ministers meet. \par \par \uc2  Fears of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  also played a strong part in weakening the yen and strengthening the euro, analysts said, ahead of Japanese gross domestic product data next week. \par \par \uc2  Moody's Investors Service downgraded Japan's sovereign debt to Aa2 from Aa1 in a widely anticipated move. The yen came under further pressure after data showed an 11.7 percent slide in Japan's machinery orders in July from the previous month. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, sterling fell to seven-year lows against the dollar for the third consecutive day amid speculation that British interest rates would stay on hold for the months to come amid benign inflation. \par \par \uc2  "The downgrade was not a surprise but nonetheless it does does not help the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , especially when we had weak machinery orders data," said Audrey-Childe Freeman, economist at CIBC World Markets. \par \par \uc2  "In a sense the downgrade came at a good time for the euro and for investors to take profits in euro/yen, but it is not a beginning of an upward trend for the euro, it is just profit-taking." \par \par \uc2  The dollar rose as far as 105.75 yen , up a yen from two-month lows near 104.75 set a day ago. \par \par \uc2  The euro was hovering a yen above Thursday's record lows around 90.90 yen . It was up nearly a cent from Thursday's record lows around $0.8630 . \par \par \uc2  "There is some short covering going on ahead of the weekend," said a trader at a German bank in Frankfurt. \par \par \uc2  "Although there is no change in sentiment for the euro, there are fears that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  is preparing to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the markets could go crazy if that happens and if euro/yen soars up then euro/dollar would rise with it." \par \par \uc2  Senior Finance Ministry official Zembei Mizoguchi said the recent rise in the yen was too rapid and added Finance Minister Kiichi Miyazawa has ordered ministry officials to act against such advances in Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "The price action in euro/yen has been scrutinised by Japanese officials. While the ECB (European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is reluctant to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the BOJ is happy to do that, as history shows," said Mark Henry, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at GNI. \par \par \uc2  "With GDP figures out on Monday, there is a very good chance the BOJ will step into the market then to get euro/yen higher and 90 will be defended." \par \par \uc2  EURO HOLDS GAINS AS ECOFIN MEET \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  managed to hold onto most of the gains it made against the yen and the dollar after hitting record lows on Thursday amid wariness as euro zone finance ministers (Ecofin) start a three-day meeting later in the day. \par \par \uc2  While the euro's rise to the day's highs coincided with comments from ECB's Executive Board member Sirkka Hamalainen who said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had carefully avoided overreacting to short-term developments when setting interest rates and that it was not happy with the euro's value on the foreign exchnages, traders said the rise was not related to these comments. \par \par \uc2  The single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  however fell back after European Monetary Affairs Commissioner Pedro Solbes told Spanish newspapar El Mundo that the ECB should not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the euro but focus on inflation. \par \par \uc2  "People don't expect a lot from the Ecofin, but this is a very nervous market, given the moves we have seen, and I don't think investors want to be short," said Lee Ferridge, head of global \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategy at Rabobank. \par \par \uc2  German sources said on Thursday euro zone finance ministers planned a statement at the talks on Friday to push home the message that the euro was out of line with fundamentals. \par \par \uc2  However they said it was unlikely the statement by the so-called Euro Group - comprising the 11 members of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  union plus Greece, which will join next year - would refer to \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Traders are awaiting comments from ECB President Wim Duisenberg who is scheduled to speak on "International role of the euro" at 1530 GMT in Calgary. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the euro was likely to resume its recent decline, especially if there was no \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the central banks to prop up the beleaguered single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Chase today revised its three-month forecast for the euro down to $0.80 from a forecast of $0.89 made a month ago. It also revised its 12-month forecast down to $0.82 from the previous $0.90. \par \par \uc2  Elsewhere, the Australian dollar hovered near record lows around US$0.5530 even though dealers in London said on Thursday the Reserve Bank of Australia was buying the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend it at levels just below US$0.56. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw9808h70\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
